{"speciesId":169,"names":{"fr":"Nostenfer","es":"Crobat","en":"Crobat","ja":"クロバット"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"It flies so si­ lently through the dark on its four wings that it may not be noticed even when nearby."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"The development of wings on its legs enables it to fly fast but also makes it tough to stop and rest."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"As a result of its pursuit of faster, yet more silent flight, a new set of wings grew on its hind legs."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"If this POKéMON is flying by fluttering only a pair of wings on either the forelegs or hind legs, it’s proof that CROBAT has been flying a long distance. It switches the wings it uses if it is tired."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"CROBAT sneaks up on its intended prey using wings that barely make a sound. This POKéMON rests by hanging on a tree branch with its rear legs that serve as wings."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"Over the course of evolution, its hind legs turned into wings. By alternately resting its front and rear wings, it can fly all day without having to stop."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"The development of wings on its legs enables it to fly fast but also makes it tough to stop and rest."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It flies so silently through the dark on its four wings that it may not be noticed even when nearby."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Having four wings enables it to fly faster and more quietly. It turns active when the night comes."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"A Pokémon that gained vastly enhanced flying performance by having its legs turn into wings."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"The transformation of its legs into wings made it better at flying, but more clumsy at walking."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It flies so silently through the dark on its four wings that it may not be noticed even when nearby."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"The development of wings on its legs enables it to fly fast but also makes it tough to stop and rest."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"La transformation de ses pattes en ailes a certes amélioré sa capacité à voler, mais pas à marcher."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"The transformation of its legs into wings made it better at flying, but more clumsy at walking."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"La transformation de ses pattes en ailes a certes amélioré sa capacité à voler, mais pas à marcher."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"The transformation of its legs into wings made it better at flying, but more clumsy at walking."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Having four wings allows it to fly more quickly and quietly so it can sneak up on prey without its noticing."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Having four wings allows it to fly more quickly and quietly so it can sneak up on prey without its noticing."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il vole en silence dans l’obscurité à l’aide de ses quatre ailes. On ne l’entend pas, même s’il est très proche."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Es tan silencioso cuando vuela en la oscuridad con sus cuatro alas, que cuesta percibirlo cuando se acerca."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It flies so silently through the dark on its four wings that it may not be noticed even when nearby."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"４枚に 増えた 翼で 暗闇を 静かに 飛んでいく。 となりを 通られても 気づかない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Ses quatre ailes lui permettent de voler furtivement pour approcher ses proies sans les effrayer."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Al contar con cuatro alas, puede acechar de manera más rápida y sigilosa a sus presas sin que estas lo perciban."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Having four wings allows it to fly more quickly and quietly so it can sneak up on prey without its noticing."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"４枚に 増えた 羽を 使い さらに 速く 静かに 飛んで 獲物に 気づかれず 忍びよる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Lorsque Nostenfer vole depuis longtemps, il utilise ses ailes antérieures ou postérieures en alternance. Il peut aisément changer de paire d’ailes lorsqu’il est fatigué."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Cuando este Pokémon vuela batiendo solo las alas delanteras o traseras, es porque lleva volando bastante tiempo. Cuando se cansa, Crobat alterna las alas."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"If this Pokémon is flying by fluttering only a pair of wings on either the forelegs or hind legs, it’s proof that Crobat has been flying a long distance. It switches the wings it uses if it is tired."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"腕か 足の どちらかだけで 羽ばたいている ときは 長い 距離を 飛んでいる 証拠。 疲れると 羽ばたく ハネを 変えるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Nostenfer s’approche discrètement de sa proie grâce à ses ailes silencieuses. Ce Pokémon se repose en s’accrochant à une branche avec ses pattes arrière, qui peuvent aussi lui servir d’ailes."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Crobat se acerca hasta su posible presa usando las alas casi sin hacer ruido. La forma de descansar que tiene es colgarse de la rama de un árbol por las patas traseras."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Crobat sneaks up on its intended prey using wings that barely make a sound. This Pokémon rests by hanging on a tree branch with its rear legs that serve as wings."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"耳を すまさないと 聞こえないほど 小さな 羽音で ねらった 獲物に 忍び寄るぞ。 後ろ足の ハネで 枝に つかまり 休む。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Comme ses pattes sont devenues des ailes, il a du mal à se mouvoir sur terre. Il ne peut que se traîner péniblement au sol."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Tiene una movilidad muy reducida en el suelo, ya que sus patas se transformaron en alas. La única opción que le queda es arrastrarse."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"Both its legs became wings, and as a result, it can’t move well on the ground. All it can do is crawl around."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"両足も 羽になった 結果 地上での 動きは 苦手。 はいずりまわることしか できない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Il vole vite et sans bruit grâce à ses quatre ailes, mord sa proie sans se faire remarquer, et disparaît aussi vite, la laissant exsangue."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Puede volar rápida y sigilosamente gracias a sus cuatro alas. Se abalanza sobre sus presas y les chupa toda la sangre antes de que se percaten."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"Silent and swift in its four-winged flight, it bites down on its prey before they realize what’s happening. In a heartbeat, it drains their blood."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"４枚の羽で 速く静かに 飛ぶ。 気づかれる前に 獲物を ガブリ。 あっというまに 血を 抜き去るぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Ses crocs sont si acérés qu’il peut sucer le sang de ses proies dans l’obscurité sans même qu’elles s’en rendent compte."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Sus colmillos son tan afilados que su mordedura resulta indolora y puede chupar la sangre a sus presas en la oscuridad sin que se percaten."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Its fangs are so sharp, if it bites you in the dark and sucks your blood, you won’t notice any pain or realize you’ve been bitten."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"キバが 鋭いので 暗闇で 噛まれ 血を 吸われても 痛みが なくて すぐに 気が つかない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il se nourrit du sang frais d’humains et de Pokémon. S’il en manque ne serait-ce qu’un instant, il s’affaiblit et ne peut plus voler."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Se alimenta de sangre fresca de humanos y Pokémon. Debe alimentarse constantemente o, de lo contrario, se vuelve débil y no puede volar."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It feeds on the blood of living people and Pokémon. If it can’t drink any blood for even a short while, it becomes weak and unable to fly."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"人や ポケモンの 生き血が エサ。 少し 吸わないで いるだけで 弱って 飛べなくなって しまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Ses pattes sont devenues des ailes. Il fond sur sa proie furtivement puis plante ses crocs dans sa nuque."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Sus patas se han convertido en alas. Se lanza sobre su presa en un vuelo silencioso a alta velocidad y le clava los colmillos en la nuca."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Both of its legs have turned into wings. Without a sound, Crobat flies swiftly toward its prey and sinks its fangs into the nape of its target’s neck."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"両足が 羽に 変化。 音を たてずに 高速で 飛び 獲物の うなじに キバを たてる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il vole en contrôlant librement ses quatre ailes et peut se déplacer sans avoir besoin de ralentir, même dans les grottes étroites."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Controla de forma independiente cada una de sus cuatro alas. Puede revolotear por cuevas estrechas sin aminorar la velocidad."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"This Pokémon flaps its four wings skillfully. Crobat can fly through cramped caves without needing to slow down."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"４枚の 羽を 自在に 操り 羽ばたく。 狭い 洞窟でも スピードを 落とさず 飛びまわれる。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"Its hind limbs have become another set of wings. Crobat expertly maneuvers its four wings to dart in exquisite fashion through even the most confined caves without losing any speed."}],"varieties":[{"id":169,"moves":[{"name":"gust","learns":[[24,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"wing-attack","learns":[[3,"level-up",30],[4,"level-up",30],[5,"level-up",21],[6,"level-up",21],[7,"level-up",21],[8,"level-up",17],[9,"level-up",17],[10